      "n": 0
    },
    {
      "start": 22.76,
      "end": 30.56,
      "text": "Third, normalize the audio to minus sixteen LUFS, which is the standard for online video platforms.",
      "n": 0
    },
    {
      "start": 30.91,
      "end": 36.718,
      "text": "Finally, export at fifteen megabits per second, and never trust the first render.",
      "n": 0
    },
